###### 3.3.11 Area of $Δ\mathbf v_i, Δ\mathbf v_j$-Enclosed *Parallelogram*

There are two alternatives the determine the *area* of the parallelogram spanned by the two *vectors* $\mathbf v_i, \mathbf v_j$:

$\text{ 1. approach : } area_{\mathbf v_i, \mathbf v_j} = |\mathbf v_j| \cdot sin(\mathbf v_i, \mathbf v_j)$

$\text{ 2. approach : }area_{\mathbf v_i, \mathbf v_j} = |Δ\mathbf v'_i||Δ\mathbf v_j|\cdot cos(90-\theta)$

where:

$Δ\mathbf v'_i \cdot Δ\mathbf v_i = 0 \;\;; \text{ orthogonality }$  

"

